@node Concepts
@chapter Concepts
@cindex concepts
@cindex terminology

This chapter defines the terms the rest of the manual uses.  Each term
names a first-class object in the Beads data model; the commands that
create and manipulate them are documented in @ref{Issue Workflow}, and
the interface patterns that present them are in @ref{Getting Started}.

